    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Ravager",
    "summary": "Choosing this model to shoot in your [Shooting Phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase) lets you Empower it for one [Pain token](vsdata:ability/drukhari.power-from-pain). Once it finishes shooting, designate an enemy unit that took a hit from it as suppressed. Each attack by a model from that unit suffers a [Hit roll](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls) penalty of 1 while suppressed. Suppression ends when your next turn begins.",
